tile.tst.essentia_discretizer.tooltip.02=Ensure essentia cell is sufficient,otherwise,inserted CrystalEssence will be thorough item and will not be recognized by the infusion provider supplier as essentia.
tile.tst.essentia_discretizer.tooltip.03=This block was inspired by ae2t. We are grateful for its exploration in this area.
tile.tst.essentia_discretizer.tooltip.04=With the update of version 2.9.0, this block has lost its significance.Perhaps it can now be used to quickly convert CrystalEssence back into essentia?
